Z||000002||TheFiero64||02-25-2001||03:57 PM||||That used to happen to me too. It seemed like the oil wouldn't stick to the dip stick. I just took a little sand paper and went over the dip stick lightly. The oil shows nice and even now.<P>------------------<BR>Josh<BR>88 Coupe V6<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/TheFiero64_signature1.gif">   <BR><A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumList?u=1249362" TARGET=_blank>My pics</A>||||reg||4
